-- One subscription start used by two programs of two modules
-- (docs/design/browser-inline.md §7): `A.program`, beside the start, writes
-- it in place; `B.program`, in another module, calls the piece `A` lifts,
-- which `A` must export whichever program the pass saw first. The page
-- mounts `B.program`; a push counts.
import A
import B
import Tea


main : Tea.Program
main = if A.first then A.program else B.program
